contentText:
Hear the rumble? After a series of recent single releases and the debut of his Contra event this past weekend in Berlin, the Skrillex machine continues shifting towards high gear with the announcement of a forthcoming new album from the artist.

On his Instagram Stories on Monday, Skrill shared the name and track list of his fifth studio LP, Soma . While a release date has not yet been announced, what&#8217;s certain is that the album will include 13 tracks including his March Young Miko collab &#8220;Duro,&#8221; &#8220;La Noche 2&#8221; (which seems likely to be an update to his 2025 Chris Lake and Anita B Queen collab &#8220;La Noche&#8221;) and last week&#8217;s &#8220;Thistle&#8221; with Randomer, Blawan and MC Dricka. See the complete track list below.

Related

