BTS Add Extra Melbourne Show to Australian Leg of ARIRANG World Tour

Soma is the first new album from Skrillex since the April 2025 release of &nbsp; F*CK U SKRILLEX YOU THINK UR ANDY WARHOL BUT UR NOT!!&nbsp;<3 , which was effectively a 46-minute megamix assembled from 36 tracks. That album came after the February 2023 release of Quest For Fire , which Skrill followed with the surprise-release of another album, Don&#8217;t Get Too Close , the next day.

These projects were the first LPs from the producer since his 2014 full-length debut Recess and followed a series of hyped pop-up shows in New York City alongside Four Tet and Fred again&#8230; The frenzy around these sets culminated in the last-minute announcement of the trio&#8217;s headlining show at Madison Square Garden , which sold out in minutes.

The artist has a busy summer schedule that includes performances at Barcelona&#8217;s Primavera Sound this weekend, a headlining slot at Bonnaroo, appearances at Kappa Future Festival in Turin, Italy, Dekmantel in The Netherlands, Hungary&#8217;s Sziget, England&#8217;s Boomtown and a headlining show alongside Boys Noize at Portola , where the pair will revive their early 2010s bass bomb side project, Dog Blood.

